  unitName: "Redtail Rebel Fe\xF2ra"
  unitId: 860788
  unitNumber: 8553
  description: "A new-generation descendent of the Sciuri beastkin tribe, whose totem
    animals can be deduced from their members' round ears and large, plush tails.
    However, few bestial traits outside of such identifiers remain expressed in these
    children, to better assimilate into a society dominated by humans.As befits certain
    groups of moody teenagers, Fe\xF2ra found herself chafing at the trappings of
    modern society despite its numerous conveniences. Fe\xF2ra's temperamental attitude
    sometimes culminates in aggression, and both she and the discipline committee
    have lost track of how many times she has run afoul of the law. The giant spiked
    bat she carries everywhere with her (as an intimidation tactic only, swears Fe\xF2ra)
    does little to help her case.Musing on the bleakness of a future ensconced in
    this nagging feeling, Fe\xF2ra found herself idly scuffing the ground in the
    woods. She passed off her these vestigial instincts as personality quirks, but
    there was no denying that something felt natural about it. Even if it was no
    longer needed in this generation of lab-grown consumables.Suddenly, her tail
    fluffed up in agitation, warnings chirping in alarm inside her head. It was with
    trepidation, not her usual arrogance, that she swung her bat when her eyes met
    those glowing yellow orbs. Mistaking flight for fight would ordinarily have ended
    in disaster, but the creature\u2014who turned out to be a harmless druid of the
    old ways\u2014was thankfully amiable enough not to return the favor.An unlikely
    friendship soon sprang up between them, and though Fe\xF2ra would remain outwardly
    dismissive of his old-fashioned backwardness, she came to see that nature was
    truly in her blood after all."
  summonDesc: Hey, how'd you get in here?<br>This place is off-limits, pal. Go fly
    a kite.<br>...Why are you questioning ME? You a cop or something?
  fusionDesc: You again with the bribes, yer worse than the cops.<br>*munch*<br>...Quit
    goupin' at me!
  evoDesc: How's THAT for a fresh new look?!<br>Pure dead brilliant eh?<br>...You
    want me to hit a big purple guy with this? Why?
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
